{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Descend Into the Abyss</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pressure Inc. is an online co-op horror game featuring a procedural underwater world, proximity voice chat and creepy monsters. Go solo or with up to 4 players and  and dive deep into the unforgiving ocean to scavenge loot and resources but be careful, you are not alone. Face lurking dangers and try to survive as long as possible to reach the hidden depths and conquer the ocean. Upgrade your submarine and equipment to improve your chances, strengthen your defenses, and better face the horrors that lurk in the deep.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473920/extras/46e36c1c5fb42d3553e25d8eb2be0cee.poster.avif?t=1769469052\" width=668 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473920/extras/46e36c1c5fb42d3553e25d8eb2be0cee.webm?t=1769469052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473920/extras/46e36c1c5fb42d3553e25d8eb2be0cee.mp4?t=1769469052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Life in the depths</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your will pilot a submarine as your main vehicle of trasportation in the ocean, so treat it with care. Learn to pilot it , repair critical systems, stop water leaks, and prevent the reactor from exploding. Managing limited resources and making the best out of bad situations will become your daily routine. Teamwork, communication, and stress management will be your greatest challenges, so choose your friends wisely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473920/extras/93dbe50f491f887ce7e85847a3ce5d40.poster.avif?t=1769469052\" width=668 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473920/extras/93dbe50f491f887ce7e85847a3ce5d40.webm?t=1769469052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473920/extras/93dbe50f491f887ce7e85847a3ce5d40.mp4?t=1769469052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3473920?t=1769469052","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473920/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769469052","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473920/c3da01d9b7bcd6a1c117df5ad588df498cd4ab9f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769469052","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473920/c3da01d9b7bcd6a1c117df5ad588df498cd4ab9f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769469052","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"As deep-sea adventurers, you must battle the horrors lurking in the abyss, withstand the crushing pressure of the depths, and face the harsh reality that your teammates may die, only  to be revived if you are given the chance. But above all, you must brave the unknown, for in the darkest waters, unseen terrors await."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Descend Into the Abyss</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pressure Inc. is an online co-op horror game featuring a procedural underwater world, proximity voice chat and creepy monsters. Go solo or with up to 4 players and  and dive deep into the unforgiving ocean to scavenge loot and resources but be careful, you are not alone. Face lurking dangers and try to survive as long as possible to reach the hidden depths and conquer the ocean. Upgrade your submarine and equipment to improve your chances, strengthen your defenses, and better face the horrors that lurk in the deep.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473920/extras/46e36c1c5fb42d3553e25d8eb2be0cee.poster.avif?t=1769469052\" width=668 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473920/extras/46e36c1c5fb42d3553e25d8eb2be0cee.webm?t=1769469052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473920/extras/46e36c1c5fb42d3553e25d8eb2be0cee.mp4?t=1769469052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Life in the depths</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your will pilot a submarine as your main vehicle of trasportation in the ocean, so treat it with care. Learn to pilot it , repair critical systems, stop water leaks, and prevent the reactor from exploding. Managing limited resources and making the best out of bad situations will become your daily routine. Teamwork, communication, and stress management will be your greatest challenges, so choose your friends wisely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473920/extras/93dbe50f491f887ce7e85847a3ce5d40.poster.avif?t=1769469052\" width=668 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473920/extras/93dbe50f491f887ce7e85847a3ce5d40.webm?t=1769469052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473920/extras/93dbe50f491f887ce7e85847a3ce5d40.mp4?t=1769469052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Dead Waters"],"genres":